 her you’re a budding engineer\, a lifelong learner\, or just love discov
 ering something new\, there’s something for everyone. Thanks to generous
  support from Micron\, admission is FREE for all guests! What to Expect 
 – Free admission: Explore The Tech’s interactive exhibits and discover
  your inner innovator. – Hands-on STEM labs (1 to 4 p.m.): Get creative 
