DESCRIPTION:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/454-with-pig-the-gemini-cafe-d
 u-nord-tickets/14351274\nVenue: Cafe Du Nord\nLocation: 2174 Market St.\, 
 San Francisco\, CA\nPrice: $33\nGenres: Music\, Hip-Hop/Rap\, Other\nCateg
 ories: ai\, edm\nSource: ticketmaster/music\n\nBorn and raised in Orlando\
 , 454 was exposed to every genre\, which shaped his musical palette and le
 d him to FL Studio. He'd skate by day and make beats by night\, honing his
  technical skills. His debut project 4 REAL (2021) is his first complete b
 ody of work and the perfect introduction to 454. Since 4 REAL became the s
 oundtrack to Homer\, Frank Ocean's new luxury brand\, 454 toured the count
